   "does": "On the main actor: if HealthKit is available, fetches the last 24 h of heart-rate samples (3 s timeout) and returns {bpm (rounded), source, age_seconds} for the newest sample; a timeout is reported as a timeout (notYetComputed), not as 'no samples'.",
